                  {
                      "kind":  "step",
                      "n":  1,
                      "id":  "-",
                      "text":  "Wait in the main menu until it is shown completely (no AutoStart in this profile)"
                  },
                  {
                      "kind":  "step",
                      "n":  2,
                      "id":  "-",
                      "text":  "Press L3 + R3: TruMenu Outfits page - the list must contain dlc_costume_a, _h, _k, _l, _m, _p (object names; a change of outfit there needs a level load). Close the menu"
                  },
                  {
                      "kind":  "step",
                      "n":  3,
                      "id":  "-",
                      "text":  "Downloadable content -\u003e Beneath the Ashes -\u003e Play mission -\u003e Enter: the outfit list appears"
                  },
                  {
                      "kind":  "check",
                      "id":  "outfit-list",
                      "text":  "Outfit list shows the six new costumes with their names and preview images: Classic Lara, Legend Lara, Red Drysuit, Blue Wetsuit, Fashion Winner, People\u0027s Choice (besides the DLC 1 costumes; German names may differ)"
                  },
                  {
                      "kind":  "check",
                      "id":  "outfit-blue-bikini",
                      "text":  "Is Blue Bikini (DLC 1 slot b) in the list? On 29.10. the list was B/W bikini, camo, casual explorer, gold, grey jungle shorts - note yes / no (open point, docs\\COSTUMES.md)"
                  },
                  {
                      "kind":  "step",
                      "n":  4,
                      "id":  "-",
                      "text":  "Choose \"Red Drysuit\" (dlc_costume_k), any weapon, let the level load; walk, jump, climb a ledge; then pause -\u003e back to the mission screen and choose the next costume"
                  },
                  {
                      "kind":  "check",
                      "id":  "costume-k",
                      "text":  "Lara wears \"Red Drysuit\" (dlc_costume_k): looks like the preview image, no black / missing / wrong textures, no stretched or exploding mesh, hair and animations normal, no crash or display-driver box"
